      <td><strong>UT_Test_experimental</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>UT_Test_kernel</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>Smoke_A900_npupool</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=https://ascend-ci.obs.cn-north-4.myhuaweicloud.com/ops-math/package/1558/slog.tar.gz>>>>>></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>harmony-infer</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> </table><p>[2026-03-09 19:21:55] &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;CI执行结束 </p>","created_at":"2026-03-09T17:25:38+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-09T19:21:55+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":164696260,"discussion_id":"95303964aa24ac1771a20e3046c1451ec881816f","body":"<div style='font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.2;'><div style='font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 4px;'>代码可维护性: RoundIntCustom 模板目前只针对 T = int32_t 进行了特化（if constexpr(std::is_same_v<T, int32_t>)）。如果使用其他类型实例化该模板，将不会生成任何代码，可能导致未定义行为或编译错误。</div><div style='margin: 1px 0;'><strong>问题类型</strong>: 代码可维护性</div><div style='margin: 1px 0;'><strong>文件路径</strong>: <code style='font-size: 11px;'>math/round/op_kernel/arch35/round_dag.h</code></div><div style='margin: 1px 0;'><strong>行号</strong>: 64</div><div style='margin: 3px 0 1px 0; font-size: 11px;'><strong>问题代码</strong>:</div><pre style='margin: 1px 0; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10px; background: #f5f5f5; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 2px; overflow-x: auto;'>if constexpr(std::is_same_v<T, int32_t>) {</pre><div style='margin: 3px 0 1px 0; font-size: 11px;'><strong>修改建议</strong>:</div><pre style='margin: 1px 0; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10px; background: #f0f8ff; border: 1px solid #cce0ff; border-radius: 2px;'>为其他可能的类型（如 int16_t, int64_t）添加处理逻辑，或者添加静态断言以确保模板只用于 int32_t。例如：static_assert(std::is_same_v<T, int32_t>, \"RoundIntCustom only supports int32_t\");</pre><div style='margin-top: 4px; font-size: 9px; color: #999;'>---<br>此评论由代码审查工具自动生成</div></div>","created_at":"2026-03-09T17:27:50+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-09T17:28:21+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"670514ec8a1d8d50e0045991","login":"ASCEND222","object_id":"670514ec8a1d8d50e0045991","name":"dongfei","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bd/cc/701903b526992d369c282ce0909b0bea12ce3b5a2a187d0782ae2cc3aa95c67f.png?time=1769495888753","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/ASCEND222"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":64,"end_new_line":64,"start_old_line":64,"end_old_line":64,"position_type":"text"}},{"id":164696302,"discussion_id":"06c32a71ae1fa07e37ee1fe7c6630399c63d7cd7","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR主要扩展并重构了`round`算子，以支持在特定硬件架构（arch35）下对`int32`整数类型进行指定精度的四舍五入运算。原实现仅支持浮点数舍入，无法处理整数舍入到特定小数位（如十位、百位）的需求。本次修改增强了算子的功能完整性和通用性，并优化了平铺（tiling）逻辑与内核实现，以处理负小数位等多种边界情况。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n修改方案将原有逻辑拆分为整数与浮点数两条独立处理路径。在平铺阶段，新增`DoTilingI`函数，根据`decimals`参数细分为多种情况，并预计算`power`、`num`等参数。在内核层，将`RoundKernel`拆分为`RoundKernelI`（处理`int32`）和`RoundKernelF`（处理浮点），并新增了`RoundIntCustom`等内核及对应的DAG结构体，以支持多种整数舍入模式。整体上，通过代码重构、常量优化和清晰的逻辑分离，实现了对整数舍入功能的完整支持。","created_at":"2026-03-09T17:28:02+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-09T17:28:02+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":164786744,"discussion_id":"e56d570536947e81ef6e44067e565b0de9c9d1be","body":"### Notification  \nThis pull request source branch has changed, so removes the following label(s): ci-pipeline-passed.","created_at":"2026-03-10T14:24:50+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-10T14:24:50+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":164786749,"discussion_id":"522e77f96200b731316c3b8d7dc8bbc3bf9af404","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-03-10T14:24:51+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-10T14:24:51+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":164786754,"discussion_id":"72937c1b54b9520349f15cc5ff3f126bd3dd31ec","body":"### CLA Signature Pass  